      "name": "vendor.myndhyve.agent-orchestration",
      "version": "1.0.3",
      "description": "MyndHyve agent-orchestration pack. Twelve nodes: six agent primitives (spawn, delegate-smart, consensus-vote, message-send, skill-invoke, swarm-execute) and six coordination strategies (vote, consensus, compete, map-reduce, delegate, round-robin). Routes through the host's agent runtime (ctx.agentRuntime.*). Inherits suspend mechanics for low-confidence escalation.",
